DESCRIPTION:Our Speaker this week will be Matt Shadle\, Catholic theologia
 n\, ethicist\, and author of The Window Light newsletter - "Pope Leo's Ma
 gnifica Humanitas\, on AI and human finitude".\n\nThe Congregation's week
 ly Adult Forum offers a variety of guest speakers\, presentations and dis
 cussions on a wide range of thought-provoking topics\, including Biblical
  studies\, current social issues and the work of mission agencies.  Adult
  Forum aims to deepen the faith and understanding of adults through share
 d learning experiences. Classes include programs and discussions on conte
 mporary issues in light of Christian teachings.
DURATION:PT1H
