DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in learning more about the Congregation at 
 Duke University Chapel-or considering making the Congregation your church
  home?\n\nJoin us this fall for Exploring Membership\, a three-session op
 portunity to get to know one another\, learn more about the Congregation 
 and our relationship with Duke Chapel\, explore the faith and practices t
 hat shape our life together\, and consider what it means to belong and pa
 rticipate in this community.\n\nWe will gather on Sundays\, October 11\, 
 October 18\, and November 1. On October 25\, rather than meeting for clas
 s\, participants will be invited to experience the life of the Congregati
 on with fresh attention. Those who choose to become members will be welco
 med into the Congregation during worship on Sunday\, November 8.\n\nWheth
 er you are ready to become a member or simply curious to learn more\, you
  are welcome. Participating does not obligate you to join.\n\nRegister He
 re for Exploring Membership:\nhttps://congregationatdukechapel.breezechms
 .com/form/9635dd
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260923T162608Z
