DESCRIPTION:The GCC and Department of Chemistry are incredibly excited to 
 announce that the Research Symposium will be held on Monday\, October 12!
  The CRS is an event open to all members of the department: graduate stud
 ents\, undergraduates\, postdocs\, faculty\, and staff. Everyone is welco
 me to attend and present. All graduate students are encouraged to give a 
 lightning talk (5 minutes)\, full length talk (15 minutes)\, or poster pr
 esentation. CRS is a staple of department events and a chance to come in 
 as a community and enjoy good science and provided food and refreshments.
  This symposium is an opportunity to showcase the amazing chemistry with 
 posters and talks\, so don't miss out!
