DESCRIPTION:(Room 2W91)\n\nDuke offers locations where faculty\, staff and
  students can receive a free flu vaccination. Vaccinations can also be ob
 tained at Duke Primary Care providers\, area pharmacies and other locatio
 ns\, but documentation must be provided for compliance.\n\nAnnual vaccina
 tion against the flu is a condition of employment at Duke Health\; other 
 University staff and faculty working on-site must be vaccinated or have a
 n approved medical or religious exemption to maintain access to Duke's bu
 ildings and facilities.\n\nFind out more at vaccines.duke.edu.
