DESCRIPTION:This webinar will explore what values are and how they act as 
 guiding principles that influence the way we think\, make decisions\, beh
 ave\, and pursue long-term goals. Participants will be introduced to comm
 on values\, learn how values shape our priorities and choices\, begin ide
 ntifying which values are most important to them\, and explore how those 
 values influence their everyday decisions.
DURATION:PT1H
