DESCRIPTION:Location: EOHW Walk-ins\n\nDuke offers locations where faculty
 \, staff and students can receive a free flu vaccination. Vaccinations ca
 n also be obtained at Duke Primary Care providers\, area pharmacies and o
 ther locations\, but documentation must be provided for compliance.\n\nAn
 nual vaccination against the flu is a condition of employment at Duke Hea
 lth\; other University staff and faculty working on-site must be vaccinat
 ed or have an approved medical or religious exemption to maintain access 
 to Duke's buildings and facilities.\n\nFind out more at vaccines.duke.edu
 .
