CREATED:20260923T193806Z
DESCRIPTION:H. Newland Oldham Lectureship\n\nTitle of Presentation:\n"Chan
 ging Surgical Culture"\n\nSpeaker:\nThoralf M. Sundt\, MD\nEdward D. Chur
 chill Professor of Surgery\, Harvard Medical School\, Chief\, Division of
  Cardiac Surgery\, Mass General Brigham Heart and Vascular Institute\n\n\
 nThis talk will be recorded and made available for on-demand viewing. Ple
 ase visit our website linked below for access.\n\nThe mission of Surgery 
 Grand Rounds is to provide an educational format that has a broad appeal 
 to Duke faculty\, residents\, staff\, and students. Grand Rounds consists
  of a broad range of topics that are presented by local\, regional\, and 
 international speakers on clinical education\, research science\, and dev
 elopments in technology\, and also addresses other related issues that ma
 y affect our current and future surgeons. Physicians who attend Surgery G
 rand Rounds are eligible to receive CME credit.\n\nFor more information\,
  please visit our website by clicking on MORE EVENT INFORMATION below
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260923T194437Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T080000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T194437Z
